  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "周師伐紂，剋於牧野。甲子平旦，天下悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6c00b320f6b908070627ca462dd2cb9e3a4fc8ba728ff08416dbfab6fa898139",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:36e53b32f4757b56b3a3ff71e678c79fd1c112d207a93e4f26f9e13af9ebb091"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "任武負力，東征不伏。陷履泥塗，雄師敗覆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:65fe56a73d1a4bcab31c34704aa430d1728dcf49c3db85dc66f4558f6730fad8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:995558689a0d7c48dec1b7fcf159b259157301025e96e88c0238a05ebaa2bc5b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "義不勝情，以欲自營。覬利危躬，折角摧頸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2d47395ba9fac1322d160d52bf8f6b13c9cc2dee68b7a6de03f4c6bb8b45c5ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0952c44f365e5db72963ae82f63209e5dc920e6bf39e3a5d7a290cef53e5fdb8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "懸貆素餐，食非其任。失輿剝廬，休坐徙居，室家何憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e70571bf36cf7715f402824526194a1b25a513384435ea4c25965453816bd5be",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:06eca834d56481ee22397ed69e5c7070e8492afa508e5163f3404f3adb941a46"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "鶹鴟娶婦，深目窈身。折腰不媚，與伯相背。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4a1dcaf59c565c1b39329f0e56e84fb7a726622f1c671cb83ff42b4d8af5207b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c37d94e81cfb0fc3aee0eb32ed5addd032030c80688c7f574838999db59a6cf4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "東風解凍，河川流通。西門子產，陞擢有功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a0e50a0dc354301784c53628355f6dc49c6936ed2a9321d5f3b8ab498fe29904",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ca1a5ee16c85213388aefd03ce15c957f5c44cf8307caa45207f313fbf118767"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "三足俱行，傾危善僵。六指不便，累慁弟兄。樹柱閡車，失其正當。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:321207df24a93b586b6556bd4f676bbd40b076cf9bd9019291114513489c812b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1fbba68f42465d7fcba74687817e22c4fa2a4844393e6a55dc9e252220b86d82"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "京庾積倉，黍稷以興。亟行疾至，以厭飽食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a8e30cec10e8a120f534cad991935fca7c67083c4a82f0362204af6eba766406",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c96a1dd5d7684e642ecb43391795b9829236d2da13e345c793e120ef401bbfae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "南山之蹊，真人所在。德配唐虞，天命為子。保祐歆享，身受大慶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cfeac9064c91ac457a8196bd3faaac9d9055f11de3612bf856703db114a83c7f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7423d2752e8293bfcf4e245bbd6aebe51a17128674fbc1d8596be3cc6926818c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "車馳人趨，卷甲相仇。齊魯寇戰，敗於犬丘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7e9cbf869fc34b1302586ccd5194bc3ba058115e67a34fee31ea2bfd897cb248",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:67666ea55b89d40292c1f497859abf681c7f9bdb4e7f5d7159b074a53baabb65"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "十五許室，柔順有德。霜降歸嫁，夫以為合。先王日至，不利出域。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:360633ccc0c38bd1a960daea15324086e3ae2e484e7c9c23fe2d45ad3c70b2ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8d2dbe91f6f50477a16539638600f1c7f493873694755d99927af745570e686e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "任力劣薄，遠托邦國。輔車不僵，為癰所傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:290258a4f4fd9ab5e98210ba42d2dc5918615c7dc9782ac8fe78d659799bfce9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:63a7a61b29bf555179f90678d3085288798ef956abde95c9c0b5f763a9034239"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "千載舊室，將有困急。荷糧負囊，出門直北。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cb05378e995a2927ee92363b26dcfd75b717d1d1888e017fcdcab2376aebcbae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e955a6a200f5511e5bc83a94b39dde81915bfd32de4723d74980fa590c83a42f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "惡災殆盈，日益章明。禍不可救，三郤夷傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7d6a252efdc2d76cdf14d401bbf3f62b2b9df4e91347f348eb2940e902504366",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:49ed617f4051c46a64874096780907f10d91e199895506e46193976f54f4b444"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "冠危載患，身驚不安。與禍馳逐，凶來入門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:73299d547e5d809511e53809786251e4fdeef0b71c601f4a25fc40c68afc24de",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0f81316fc8fbf169921403eb4f32c2878b6d8eeae2a67e730b5708b90e6836da"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "虎狼並處，不可以事。忠謀轉改，禍必及己。退隱深山，身乃不殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:586f959f040bc640cc211fb3537c4fcbd2626af1e49289b6490ce4f41987f4d9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c3f33983f8007621c8b22776571df333cd3f63f944756fa3eb97a576b789550f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "卵與石鬥，糜碎無處。挈瓶之使，不為憂懼。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:289d73c6dec30446d421f97a9e459343afa2b1d238ba2f4987e5bb71cbca7afd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c2c3e0b1431c1ca58569c79c35a263bb908997504aa16267946895268f8b6ab7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "五心六意，岐道多怪。非君本志，生我恨悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:985511bbb1eb8b22a00f31d0545f4d60b8c50df2e3804428fde81ab3e297648f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5c6079e84b74678478c6f07b675172fbdba76b49ce71286e70c8615638a775de"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "雨雪載塗，東行破車，旅人無家。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b236d5631f8f00cdc179287d51733d4cb3613c10895208723937c5d5c033f3c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:333f54a8cec7a833ead2e1f06cf0456be67b1bb458f949ad15803723975e3b3f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "尚利壞義，月出平地。國亂天常，咎徵滅亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8c1307f1d43a544d76e0b7ab62ecdd3c779c2e6a838e9ad4b63ebe45f642b147",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ce8f521ecce9d9653cfc2349bebbac05363fcc3a415e61433a80ecf09148ac1b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "東行破車，步入范家。衡門穿射，無以為主。賣袍續食，糟糠不飽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:46115ae0b51b414e39186f514b2ec518843b70dd34a67c041c704f39b0bad6e7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b57fd33033c747b529415611430d690765e3b6005787bb3a6df2b2f71823a026"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "逐金出門，并失玉丸。往來井上，甑破缺盆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:47fc610d53c492fa3149774f15e7f6f1188e2339d6d17ddda222d0968f42e4a4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1eae3f4abaeb75d8d97976f0e394c023154b1f09f41f5af04854cc998dcfa49e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "春孟醴酒，使君壽考。南山多福，宜行賈市。秋梁雌雉，所至利喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1b579e3b01904558b13e59000c035919d28795ffc1477b601fd2113de5fd807b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a9ee71dd448923cd8579ada740f10d7a0df227bc634afc95622f94b69f0e3a17"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "持刃操肉，對酒不食。夫亡從軍，長子入獄，抱膝獨宿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ac5890251648f0932dc7c2c198111bd98e5ddc6cea18d1bc7c5ac24651420eab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ccbc6fd25f729527060f575c261ca61ac53a170351b7293bfaf47d73f3c2123a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "踦牛傷暑，不能成畝。草萊不墾，年歲無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:87ec20293b6a3f44315cb9e6a586ad2c387891405fee337c7e4314553f32c723",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f0e64d52ed8d4b2cdeca030b8decc3a8304e9cb0d4fa66c16d0b4097157ad096"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "南邦大域，鬼魅滿室。讙聲相逐，為我行賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ab42661b2a292bd84e8e026d348c7ebf246968a30e042507b6974322b3ae54b2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:02c7ec31d895b64cf05ca628b3d2905a44308ec95ca52a8a743f5bb6a2e37ed1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "噂噂所言，莫如我垣。歡樂堅固，可以長安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fe76060ebde6fb99263a63d774ea2ba78e78426f7c2d7559410351c29eaa946f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b1150c7d96ce31ae6e638fd7e643cd51ae9b10e6b8b6a5a9c50519bd7b1ce4ff"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "堯舜禹湯，四聖敦仁。允施德音，民安無窮。旅人相望，未同朝卿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:712fa3cfc60e4354f65c039ec77d57148068cc1db9aec4058071c5faf8133014",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d096053ae31a2c5e3dab322668723056906ac6d0a66d861dd0d1c5d3fe66b00c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "桎梏拘獲，身入牢獄。髡刑受法，終不得釋。耳閉道塞，求事不得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7a4040d49c5bc12809f37f77443adcfa2d4226e4212292b86a66358c2b5c6afa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eb457f1795a9a9a44a0bf8b7267db117ba97f72363b26033dca127a80ef8e823"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "跖並桀處，民困愁苦。行旅遲遲，留連齊魯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a889284e9b54b580b73d142c157a6a4747c06eb59e2f833cc0ffb63e4d1f8a5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:269e11d047394f484038bceb5b148ac2ca0cb1222844c88e7bf89dbc37630ea5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "求雞獲雉，買鱉失魚。出入均貨，利得無餘。齊姜宋子，婚姻孔喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5918c7efcf45dca20696d50f1b67f6b409c7d2aa8c4a458a425a0003f2447dd5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e65095b3a9e8845bfd087c9a80c21956256f453473ff28e3a0880270dcd125d0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "雨師駕駟，風伯吹雲。秦楚爭強，施不得行。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bf0a014bea1b364beaafd66a0ccf41d782eb56fd81ed35617dc45ca901d89d07",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ad0c0b54db142a20df6b687fb3d77b49fa11d827dd01757a32046fa1c8156147"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "仲冬兼秋，鳥散飲憂。困於米食，數驚鸇鵰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0451548fdeac587a35ef8a9480d602e2b419b29d9d1d55866ef8277b71867f5e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:65bdf67c8618179e47959e538f7087e3252765fe28cfb739d862d7f43b1c0107"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "三羝上山，俱至陰安。遂到南陽，完其芝香。兩崖相望，未有枕狀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7cc256c927673f0d977939e39fb51a46b2654407199d8ded444489094967d6b2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4b778bfaa693e211e975a07a2c1c46c0fee638ce4779d90f10859f5a7f69a663"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "飛之日南，還歸遼東。雌雄相從，和鳴雍雍。解我胸舂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2f62af29f93ff45dd2918bae8f2b32da9597f714f85b823d6c0b61018ffc1c88",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:812ad2efe39690305a9af69615d12ded33e990f1411bfc85bf0e30458c76bc97"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "堯飲舜舞，禹拜上酒。禮樂所豐，可以安處。保我淑女。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:15ed5cf058aa0a3e1d2182c2e99ecf1e15cd6162cdfec84c1b907e51f9b2d0e1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:391a34cae02b6ca9eb3f116d34226930b281e5d9ed32f5518fad5ff819e1ec59"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "太乙置酒，樂正起舞。萬神攸同，可以安處。綏我齒兒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e67e2b047f2ed82761d62d1f500db49149ebcc61c44dfbad6fcf77d3c314a6c6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e5b6eb320ebaff578c5c2642e72b3d850801f631066e848ba886bd7e9264af60"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "白馬騂騮，生乳不休。富我商人，得利饒優。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e665fb57831751730cdabaea3425e3b22f0f0a5ed3b377f5af4b02bf8a4410fc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5f17ccd18f54438a00baf03406dfcc1a8f4b0a806a02bcfe3588db81d89cca7a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "宛馬疾步，盲師坐御。目不見路，中止不到。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1ba46d8e045f21e6341d16bdca6f59e8874f35cdc93348e1bb6f5a9f11f7b736",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:69b870654d1875621dd1cab78b6ce6ad5482d896f88cd00a2aefe84225942323"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "春桃萌生，萬物華榮。邦君所居，國樂無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8fd6e9ba1ea4a357b5ed3c78433d51ec45a74d0ddc1a58fb9df769408c9cf2b9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:94aefb3ddb679a86ade6d96fc17cf12991bb908e2847c32d8518b70a22c1ae2f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "把珠入口，蓄為玉寶。得吾所有，欣然嘉喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:be8d5d79e8ffc3ed79ac8c22e5d296ef7d29e364dccab7da693ef46b75085ef7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:341ab8524328422dcb57511ad56c4d6d5cd1db4b145af49ce93f3fbe5fa154d0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "襦燒褲燔，羸剝飢寒，病證凍攣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e322c30140e969b6ae2c5c291c0cc73266de71283ec5b0fa7fad5cead002df43",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6efbd537ef8d3ebf3594ea98b3c6b2cba52211c2919b6a7ea5ad4ff4366cf368"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "水沬沉浮，沮濕不居，為心疾憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9a9a8fec2acb8e86170ce0ed26cee1d94167703e77aa1c73ed27bc123a3731e5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:43fdb80359534b5bad23b1eb064fa7201f11458bc49f0de10374b7e7fddade92"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "行如桀紂，雖禱不祐。命衰絕周，文君乏祀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2cb366744d588f54dca924d1517170508df90707936654799eaf2b902df7f315",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:097b0dea1bc9b53ffc80e4711a9255b8606bcb4b876db8ca1d37146acfae2ac7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "蜉蝣戴盆，不能上山。腳摧跛蹶，損傷其頭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:94ef4dd8672216df0f31314deb2dd428daebb9cb4c26b3dca50f0ff500c53df9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c559ea9741171a487ee69eea61649e545f71d05f3000a2a3d376eefaaf3c181"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "長子入獄，婦饋母哭。霜降旬甚，嚮晦伏法。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:75c508b3ecbf78150ba05bf6927418f981eb1e87ce57d162670d5d93794d219d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1258015942c3312b35e8d7b2d4d8f329b0a31d9a37382bde23d5574a098e41b3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "求犬得兔，請新遇故。雖不當路，踰吾舊舍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fe789842c9c5f01a1facbbd744caf531bbdf9a07a45763f342a8cfbac1c66544",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:219eeca35c90ce54a79aa9554a34ccd30344575665a3a41c702d9e0669db7c36"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "鳥鳴葭端，一呼三顛。動搖東西，危而不安。靈符禱祉，疾病無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:50138c4cefa82c936d5ab01de824b2c8013cf72d542803222dd5aa367fde37e1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:426f7df8a8b6470f5f13b03e9371992368a1189f58933e3fa63944a8ef4e30fe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "天厭禹德，命興湯國。祓社釁鼓，以除民疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3caf2c100a39467cbd5e1c7151faf6c8576c08e07e20f54a5a954bf0a9f5fb9b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dbc4d37b37554ca26b9b942ff0e5b87a865caf0762360d42fdc8243099010aae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "陰霧作匿，不見白日。邪徑迷通，使君亂惑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bad8ef00057515f750f6c2cffc624fac9b36c527bda41350c1a5d07638348eba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:425195be222cfdb5b32d620e42d2c99ce6d7c0d1c4c8a56d220ba74c1a7eb892"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "猿墮喬木，不跛手足。握珠懷玉，還歸我室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cf48359a06390284f0f21364e8b551f617de9d8c3d04654b9313c35190ec04ef",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2565baeabb46cecb086c146c7342924d8bb4c8282def18d48935b0e9e3e43252"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "三驪負衡，南取芝香。秋蘭芬馥，盈滿篋筐，利我少姜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c860bdad6444b8ca347492034edfc81bcb20cce34c787bf9cab956d6e14c45ac",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:79444058b9b7b8d291724f225d84acd436f56c71d26bfaf6068514b055607390"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "春生孚乳，羽毛成就。舉不失宜，君臣相好。盜走奔北，終無所悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:04adb8f2a7e861c8cd7447e7ee9e235af25dbb2f025bf07d6002289926b9137c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2a8645338e9ecdcf7356312aca6c77b8148af3e578f83b6d2d85caaab379f5df"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "東行破車，還反室家。天命訖終，無所禱凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bbf4805347315dffa64d2c8fc20d761403e3dafd1fe66e02c13379638482bba8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:109f504acbdfc0643fb995b729383ce7531fd3494675e6b3c1bea014f99242ff"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "九雁列陣，雌獨不群。為罾所牽，死於庖人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1dd6928e5696965159a0fc00819a99213742d66841e35f51912f7eb7ea1aaf00",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:36fab3af54c002df272b47e5121509e19bc0a1a1e9a9382b7837b24e4e2755dd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "二人輦車，從去其家。井沸釜鳴，不可以居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:705063890a85299e89fabdbcee6afd4b3840de15a1061f6c81eef6f7014590c3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c52c3d684e9dd6ba9f4b9dace450763d81cb1fa59f69b8accc96875764587b58"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "閉塞復通，與喪相逢。甘棠之人，解我憂凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6645034d9a6b1b77a6e977ab2ddc9c75cdc5f25728fa67f1b5282150faa94e7e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f2a81b368c11eaca1c4b71c5d511912e21130c661ff5377cc594e2c035b69dea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "賦斂重數，政為民賊。杼軸空虛，家去其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c72aa9d48dcf7dae8d0f3fba6a62376c4fc09472e17939fac81174222b92b97a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a86da8ab1813d70cae3605ca746f2239ab797a466ed04a7b397ac7c78100323"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "怒非其怨，貪妒腐鼠。而呼鵲鴟，自令失餌，倒被災患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:105bebae2713f2b916d3071b0ca220fc926b8e871ad1c01a6d028ca5bb711658",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:be0dec619648bed40f780f3af47c047abdeaa188546c8a94be6e7c3af6aa3670"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "簪短帶長，幽思最苦。瘠貌少疲，以疾病降。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:87d336ee81066cb164221ead6881e4f37895011d702c4ad49af80fe2a444ccd3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:630f9f414e4f8f0d5242dd912725ff2f436511c02a16ecd5a6e16c7e5f6281b4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "三人俱行，各別採桑。蘊其筐筥，留我嘉侶。得歸無咎，四月來處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2b17752d4042470aaab0cf2d39a0b500ea1e2f7c2670ce263548da41c4814a93",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2f564bb8f1865a47d48419be930601e8f8a52a13458a6a7ed99a6401e1eefd52"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "逐鳩南飛，與喜相隨。井獲鹿子，多得利歸，雖憂無危。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7f2194de63816417a8fe95e0a32cdd24c9139e81afb5e2c4975913e96c912600",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ee3da0b33c0d2db377c8540e0d310548a691194b29b74126cf00494c32227a6e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "驅羊南行，與福相逢。狼驚吾馬，虎盜我子。悲恨自咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:81a2d274bdb71c5e443d784b457b26696de3daa64852f27186e9f979b6d5bc70",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:09cf1afbdb4b31a847c04dfe15a7e3497b5ad12f46fb98eadb81e5c5c23a5e72"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 24,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "東鄰西國，福喜同樂。出得隋珠，留獲和玉。俱利有息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:52b4fed08d12f306193f52b1125ecd0f207b4c504d576eec031cdaac22ddac5d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8d0e568ec8f69cb25116d613d75b1f228b62469ebdd0fd9cee3f3bc2cda18355"
    }
  ]
}
